# Hual04c carry-in combat/escort route (UU/seconds), appended to the re-timed prefix.
# Time shifts the prefix's descent so the carried loadout fights from the canyon floor.
# Real SelectWeapon exits the Hook item mode and picks the carried Beretta (group2); the
# north approach selects the carried M16 (group11) to clear the manonhighspotleft sniper.
# No teleports, grants, health writes or control overrides; only the game's own corpse
# QuickHeal medkit is used. The route clears the first encounter (soldier28/29/30), the
# second wave (2/31/32/33) and the BaseSoldier1 high-spot sniper, reaches Carrington, and
# retreats south at 2 HP; the escort then waits on the northern kill event (see the test).
t=84.00 select_weapon 2
t=86.00 select_weapon 2
t=90.00 track BaseSoldier30 0.90
t=90.10 fire
t=90.50 fire
t=90.90 fire
t=91.30 fire
t=91.70 fire
t=92.00 track BaseSoldier29 0.90
t=92.10 fire
t=92.50 fire
t=92.90 fire
t=93.30 fire
t=93.70 fire
t=94.00 track off
t=94.00 goto -3100 580
t=94.20 reload
t=96.00 heal
t=97.00 heal
t=98.00 heal
t=98.00 forward 0
# item104: BaseSoldier28 (bazooka, 2400 UU away at (-4861,-1065)) fires a rocket every ~2 s from about t=97.7
# (impacts measured at 100.27, 102.05, 104.58: 46/73/46 hp). With the friction-world dispersion the old
# 100.1 start left three rockets in flight and killed the player; the player crouches (hypothesis: lower dispersion)
# and engages at 98.3 instead, with the reload moved before the heals.
t=98.00 crouch 1
t=98.30 track BaseSoldier28 1.20
t=98.40 fire
t=98.70 fire
t=99.00 fire
t=99.30 fire
t=99.60 fire
t=99.90 fire
# BaseSoldier28 is dead by t=100.25 (measured); the second-wave bazooka soldier BaseSoldier2 (stationary at
# (-3906,-2278), launches from about 101.7) is engaged at once instead of at 102.3.
t=100.30 track BaseSoldier2 0.90
t=100.10 fire
t=100.40 fire
t=100.70 fire
t=101.00 fire
t=101.30 fire
t=101.60 fire
t=101.90 fire
t=102.20 fire
t=102.30 track BaseSoldier2 0.90
t=102.30 right 1
t=102.60 fire
