# item104: BaseSoldier32 (shotgun) walks around to (-1083,1762) and is only in sight from t~130 (measured);
# the old (Beretta) engagement hit nothing; with the M16 it dies at t=129.5 (measured), so the engagement runs
# to 129.5 and the rest of the route is delayed by 0.7 s relative to the original timeline.
